---
import Layout from "@/layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Terms of Service" description="Terms of service for Blab Bun.">
  <main class="pt-[64px]">
    <!-- Page hero -->
    <section
      class="relative overflow-hidden border-b border-[rgba(197,247,208,0.25)] px-4 pt-14 pb-12 md:px-8 md:pt-20 md:pb-16"
    >
      <div
        class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0"
        style="background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(197,247,208,0.07) 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(197,247,208,0.07) 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 40px 40px;"
      >
      </div>
      <div
        class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0"
        style="background: radial-gradient(ellipse 80% 60% at 50% 50%, transparent 40%, white 100%);"
      >
      </div>
      <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-[760px] text-center">
        <span
          class="font-manrope mb-4 inline-block rounded-full bg-[#ebf3ed] px-3 py-1 text-[10px] font-bold tracking-[3px] text-[#386547] uppercase"
        >
          Terms
        </span>
        <h1
          class="font-space-grotesk text-[48px] leading-[0.97] font-bold tracking-[-0.05em] text-[#1a2e22] sm:text-[64px] md:text-[80px]"
        >
          Terms of Use<span class="text-[#ccf05f]">.</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="font-manrope mt-3 text-[13px] text-[rgba(41,48,45,0.4)]">
          Last updated: April 2026
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="mx-auto max-w-[760px] px-4 py-14 md:px-8 md:py-20">
      <div class="space-y-8">
        <section>
          <h2
            class="font-space-grotesk mb-3 text-[20px] font-bold tracking-[-0.02em] text-[#1a2e22]"
          >
            Just reading? You&apos;re fine.
          </h2>
          <p
            class="font-manrope text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-[rgba(41,48,45,0.65)]"
          >
            This is a personal blog. By reading it, you agree to nothing
            complicated. Browse freely, share things you like, and move on with
            your day.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2
            class="font-space-grotesk mt-4 mb-3 text-[20px] font-bold tracking-[-0.02em] text-[#1a2e22]"
          >
            Content ownership
          </h2>
          <p
            class="font-manrope text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-[rgba(41,48,45,0.65)]"
          >
            Everything written here &mdash; essays, thoughts, half-baked ideas
            &mdash; belongs to me. You&apos;re welcome to quote and link with
            credit. Please don&apos;t reproduce full posts elsewhere without
            asking first.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2
            class="font-space-grotesk mt-4 mb-3 text-[20px] font-bold tracking-[-0.02em] text-[#1a2e22]"
          >
            No warranties
          </h2>
          <p
            class="font-manrope text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-[rgba(41,48,45,0.65)]"
          >
            The thoughts here are my own, written in good faith, but I&apos;m
            not an expert on everything I write about. Nothing on this site
            constitutes professional advice &mdash; legal, medical, financial,
            or otherwise. Use your own judgment.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2
            class="font-space-grotesk mt-4 mb-3 text-[20px] font-bold tracking-[-0.02em] text-[#1a2e22]"
          >
            External links
          </h2>
          <p
            class="font-manrope text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-[rgba(41,48,45,0.65)]"
          >
            Posts sometimes link to other sites. I&apos;m not responsible for
            their content, availability, or what they do with your data once you
            leave here.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2
            class="font-space-grotesk mt-4 mb-3 text-[20px] font-bold tracking-[-0.02em] text-[#1a2e22]"
          >
            Changes
          </h2>
          <p
            class="font-manrope text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-[rgba(41,48,45,0.65)]"
          >
            These terms may change as the site evolves. If something shifts
            meaningfully, I&apos;ll update the date above.
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-14 border-t border-[rgba(197,247,208,0.4)] pt-8">
        <a
          href="/"
          class="font-manrope group inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-[13px] font-bold text-[rgba(41,48,45,0.5)] transition-colors hover:text-[#386547]"
        >
          <svg
            width="14"
            height="14"
            viewBox="0 0 14 14"
            fill="none"
            aria-hidden="true"
            class="transition-transform group-hover:-translate-x-0.5"
          >
            <path
              d="M13 7H1M6 2L1 7l5 5"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="1.5"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
          </svg>
          Back home
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
